  "job_B3.4.36_20251003_114740": {
    "text": "Sermo angelorum nomina.\nHer ongin\u00f0, men \u00f0a leofestan, ymb ures drihtnes \u00e6rendgewrite be \u00f0\u00e6re halgan \u00ferynnesse, \u00fee feoll of\nAnd he hit sende \u00feam m\u00e6ssepreoste, \u00fee hatte Achorius.\nAnd he hit underfeng and sende hit to \u00f0\u00e6re ceastre, \u00fee hatte Ieremiam, and to \u00feam m\u00e6ssepreoste.\nAnd he hit asende Talasius.\nAnd Tala so\u00f0lice hit asende to Ebream \u00fe\u00e6re ceastre and to \u00feam m\u00e6ssepreoste, \u00fee hatte Lebonum.\nLebonum so\u00f0lice hit asende to Cappadociam \u00fe\u00e6re ceastre and to \u00feam m\u00e6ssepreoste, \u00fee hatte\nAnd Machabium so\u00f0lice hit asende to \u00fe\u00e6re stowe Sanctus Michael \u00fe\u00e6s heahengles.\nAnd \u00feanan hit becom to Rome and in \u00f0a burh and \u00fe\u00e6r w\u00e6s funden on Sanctus Petrus weofod and \u00feus\nAnd so\u00f0lice \u00fea, \u00f0e in \u00fe\u00e6re ceastre w\u00e6ron, heo \u00f0a dydon, swa heo \u00fe\u00e6r gewear\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t heo f\u00e6sten \u00fereo\nAnd hit w\u00e6s for\u00f0an, \u00fe\u00e6t on \u00feam halgan sunnand\u00e6ge \u00fe\u00e6t nan man hine to unnytnesse to swi\u00f0e ne\n\u00d0\u00e6t is, \u00fe\u00e6t nan man on \u00feysne d\u00e6g on dome ne sitte ne a\u00f0 ne swerige ne wyrte in lehtune ne fatige; and\nAnd nan wif hire yrfe ne meolcige, butan heo \u00f0a meolc for godes lufan sylle.\nNe mylnum nis alyfed to eornenne ne on hunta\u00f0 to ridenne ne nan unalyfedlic weorc to wyrcenne.\nFor\u00f0an \u00fee for \u00f0yssum yfelum weorcum forweor\u00f0a\u00f0 \u00feas eor\u00f0lican \u00feing, and se bifigenda dom cym\u00f0 ofer\nAnd ongeota\u00f0, ge earmingas synfulle, \u00fe\u00e6t on six dagum w\u00e6ron geworhte heofonas and eor\u00f0an, sunne\nAnd \u00fea \u00f0y seofo\u00f0an d\u00e6ge he hine gereste \u00e6fter his six daga weorcum.\nAnd swa gedafena\u00f0 \u00e6lcum men to habbenne restend\u00e6g, swa \u00f0a halgan englas reste habba\u00f0 on\nAc ic halsige on godes naman and eornostlice hate, \u00fe\u00e6t ge gecyrran to gode mid gebedum and mid\nAnd mid \u00fe\u00e6re halgan rode he us gesena\u00f0.\nAnd \u00fe\u00e6t f\u00e6sten, \u00fee \u00f0a Niniuete f\u00e6ston, f\u00e6sta\u00f0 \u00fea.\nAnd gif ge swa do\u00f0, \u00feonne ahredde\u00f0 us drihten.\nGe ermingas, efesta\u00f0 and begeota\u00f0 heofena rices wuldor, for\u00f0an d\u00e6ghwamlice se dea\u00f0 cym\u00f0 beforan\nAnd gif ge nella\u00f0 gebetan eowre misd\u00e6de and healdan \u00feone halgan sunnand\u00e6g mid rihte fram nontide\nIc s\u00e6cge, \u00fe\u00e6t on \u00feam mon\u00f0e, \u00fee hatte nouembris, \u00fe\u00e6t ge scoldan ealle forweor\u00f0an, n\u00e6re \u00fe\u00e6re halgan\nAnd \u00feurh heora bene ge w\u00e6ron alysde of \u00feam witum, \u00f0a \u00fee towearde w\u00e6ron.\nIc cwe\u00f0e to eow, gif ge willa\u00f0 fon to d\u00e6dbote, \u00feonne beo\u00f0 eow opene heofena geatu, and ic sylle eow\nAnd ic cwe\u00f0e to \u00feissum folce minum \u00feam holdan and \u00feam leofan: gewislice ge becuma\u00f0 to heofona\nBe\u00fe\u00e6nce se f\u00e6der \u00feone sunu and se sunu \u00feone f\u00e6der butan yrre and butan werignesse, \u00fe\u00e6t ge \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6t\nIc cwe\u00f0e to eow: ga\u00f0 to minum cyricum mid \u00e6lmessum and mid leohte and gehera\u00f0 \u00feone halgan sang\nIc sende eow gehadode beforan gode simble, and gif ge hym willa\u00f0 gelefan.\nIc eow halsige, min getreowe folc, \u00feurh Iordane \u00fea ea, \u00fe\u00e6r Sanctus Iohannes me \u00feone halgan fulluht\nAnd \u00feonne he se engel cw\u00e6\u00f0 to me: \u00feis is min leofa sunu, on \u00fe\u00e6m ic me wel gelicode, gehera\u00f0 him\nAnd \u00feurh \u00feis halige gewrit ic eow halsige, \u00fe\u00e6t ge \u00feysum gelefan; and ic hate, \u00fe\u00e6t ge gangen to minum\nAnd gif ge nella\u00f0 swa don, \u00feonne bende ic minne bogan, and ic sende mine flan ofer eow, and \u00feonne\nAc \u00feeahhw\u00e6\u00f0ere gecerra\u00f0 to me, ge synfulle, and forl\u00e6ta\u00f0 yfel a, for\u00f0am \u00fe\u00e6m ic mildsiende eom,\nGelefa\u00f0 \u00feyssum wordum.\nIc s\u00e6nde to eow for \u00feam halgan sunnand\u00e6ge, \u00fe\u00e6t ge ageofan \u00f0a teo\u00f0unge to godes cyrican.\nFor\u00f0am, gif ge nella\u00f0 hy ageofan gode and his preoste, he his min bro\u00f0or and min sunu \u00feam, \u00f0e to me\nIc sende on eowre hus biternesse and wanunga and granunga; and ic \u00fea eft nime fram eow for minre\nIc hate and ic halsige, \u00fe\u00e6t ge on sunnand\u00e6ge eowre heafdu ne \u00fewean ne eower fex ne efesian; and gif\nAnd gif ge nella\u00f0 betan, \u00fe\u00e6t ge to woge gedon habba\u00f0, ic sende yfel on eower hus and eorre.\nAnd ic h\u00e6bbe asend \u00feis gewrit to eow, \u00fe\u00e6t ge him gelefan.\nAnd gif ge nylla\u00f0 healdan eower word and eower wedd, ge \u00feonne beo\u00f0 adilegode of ealra lifigendra\nAnd gif ge nella\u00f0 healdan min bebod, ic sende ofer eow geswinc and mettrumnesse on andwlitan and\nSo\u00f0 is, so\u00f0 is, \u00fe\u00e6t ic eow secge, \u00fe\u00e6t ic w\u00e6s for eow on rode gen\u00e6gled, and \u00fe\u00e6r ic \u00ferowade for eow,\nOn sunnand\u00e6g w\u00e6ron englas gesceapene.\nAnd on sunnand\u00e6g reste Noes earce on \u00fe\u00e6re dune, \u00fee Armenia hatte, \u00e6fter \u00f0am miclan flode.\nOn sunnand\u00e6g l\u00e6dde drihten his folc of Egyptum \u00feurh \u00f0a readan s\u00e6 drium fotum, and his feond\nOn sunnand\u00e6g let se h\u00e6lend rinan mannan, \u00feone heofonlican mete, \u00fee he his folc mid fedde feowertig\nOn sunnand\u00e6g is seo acennednes ures drihtnes h\u00e6lendes Cristes.\nOn sunnand\u00e6g worhte drihten win of w\u00e6tere in Architriclines huse.\nOn sunnand\u00e6g gefylde se h\u00e6lend of fif hlafum and of twam fixum fif \u00feusend manna butan wifum and\nAnd on sunnand\u00e6g aras drihten of dea\u00f0e.\nAnd on sunnand\u00e6g he asende his apostolum \u00feone halgan gast on fyres ansyne.\nAnd on sunnand\u00e6g ges\u00e6t se h\u00e6lend on \u00f0a swi\u00f0ran healfe \u00fe\u00e6s heahf\u00e6der.\nAnd on sunnand\u00e6g cw\u00e6\u00f0 se h\u00e6lend: openia\u00f0 \u00feas geatu and \u00fea f\u00e6stan scytelsas, and ic wille gan\nFor\u00f0an ongeota\u00f0 ge \u00feis bebod: ic bebeode eallum minum cyriclicum larum, \u00fe\u00e6t heo be\u00feencen\nAnd \u00fea h\u00e6\u00f0enan so\u00f0lice heo ne synd cristene, ne heo god ne lufia\u00f0 ne his bebodu healdan ne willa\u00f0,\nSo\u00f0 is, so\u00f0 is, \u00fe\u00e6t ic eow secge, \u00fe\u00e6t eow is \u00feearf, \u00fe\u00e6t ge healdan \u00feone halgan sunnand\u00e6g mid rihte\nAnd gif ge nella\u00f0 \u00feyssum gewritum gelefan, ic sende ofer eow wyrmas and fuhlas wedende, and \u00fea\nAnd ic sende h\u00e6\u00f0en folc ofer eow, \u00fee eow ofnima\u00f0 eowre \u00e6hte and eower lif and eowere wif and cild,\nSo\u00f0 is, so\u00f0 is, \u00fe\u00e6t ic eow secge, gif ge lesa\u00f0 in lehtune wyrte on sunnand\u00e6g, ic sende n\u00e6dran\nGif ge ne healda\u00f0 \u00feone halgan sunnand\u00e6g, \u00f0onne beo\u00f0 on eowrum husum acennede cild, \u00fee ne geseo\u00f0\nAnd ge\u00feenca\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t ge synd \u00fe\u00e6s oft gemyngad; and gif ge healda\u00f0 mine beboda, ealle god ic gehate\nAnd swa hwylc m\u00e6ssepreost, swa h\u00e6bbe \u00feis gewrit and nelle cy\u00f0an godes folce, \u00feonne cwe\u00f0 se\n\u00d0is gewrit w\u00e6s afunden in Hierusalem, and \u00feanan hit becom to Rome and to Sancte Petres\nOngeota\u00f0 ge godes word, and his larum hersumia\u00f0, for\u00f0an \u00fee eow neal\u00e6c\u00f0 se dea\u00f0 toweardes.\nAnd gif ge nella\u00f0 gelefan, ic sende to eow beornendne ren and sweflene leg, and eow forde\u00f0 and\nAnd \u00e6fter \u00feyssum gewrite ne cym\u00f0 eow nan o\u00f0er fram me.\nAnd gelefa\u00f0 \u00feissum gewrite \u00feurh drihten sylfne and \u00feurh englas and heahenglas for \u00fe\u00e6ra mihte and\nSeo him drihtne simle \u00feanc ge \u00fe\u00e6s ge ealra his geofena, lof and wuldor a in ecnesse a butan ende,",
